175 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 45 0 R
/E (In this experiment, a custom function named CheckJobApplication was created with the Deluge language, the Default namespace and the string return type in the Job Application Form application. The function was saved, listed in the Functions section and executed successfully, returning the expected confirmation message. Although the function was simple, it illustrates the procedure for creating and running a custom function. Combining low-code development with suitable pro-code extensions can support more flexible application development, in which standard functionality is built visually and specific logic is added through code where it is required.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [24]
>>
